~ angel_talk_1
Angel: [color=#fff6ad]Don't worry about what they said, dear. I'm no monster.[/color]
Angel: [color=#fff6ad]Humanoids just love the idea of killing gods and their servants.[/color]
Angel: [color=#fff6ad]It's a very natural thing. They love to express this urge in the form of JRPGs.[/color]
Angel: [color=#fff6ad]But, my child, healthy expression is where the line should be drawn.
	Those gentlemen were very rude.[/color]
Angel: [color=#fff6ad]If I was an [i]actual[/i] angel, I would have sent them straight to Hell.[/color]
=> END

